# Local-only notes: retrospectives, design handoffs, the backend API contract.
# Must be `docs/`, not `./docs` — gitignore does not support a `./` prefix, so
# that pattern silently matches nothing. Until this was fixed the directory was
# held back only by .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone and not shared.
docs/

# Konami easter egg sounds (gradiusCoin.mp3, KonamiLogo1.mp3, KonamiLogo2.mp3).
# The audio is copyrighted and this repository is public, so it never goes
# into git. Vite serves this folder in development; production serves the same
# URLs from a folder outside dist/ on the server (see
# deploy/oci-cloudflare/Caddyfile.example).
public/media/

# Local agent/runtime configuration
.codex/

# Terraform local state and machine-specific inputs
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/terraform.tfvars
**/tf-output.txt
**/*-create.log

# Frames and banners cut from other people's uploads, plus what is measured from
# them. Rebuild with scripts/layout-analysis/.
test/fixtures/auto-roi/
test/fixtures/ocr-banners/
test/fixtures/worker-clips/
# Downloaded by tesseract.js on its first run.
*.traineddata

# .github/workflows/dependency-audit.yml이 만드는 중간 산출물. CI에서는 러너
# 안에서만 살지만, 리포트 스크립트를 로컬에서 돌려볼 때도 생깁니다.
audit-all.json
audit-prod.json
audit-report.md
